  "contract": "BF16 Q/K/V/O [N,16,64] contiguous, full bidirectional attention, FP32 dot/online accumulation, no hidden scratch. vision_full_attention: one image, B_Seqlen[0]=N. vision_split_attention: local query rows B_Seqlen[1] (Q/O local), keys/values of the full image B_Seqlen[0]; per-row arithmetic identical to vision_full_attention."
